    "detailed_description": "Become a wizard apprentice, attend classes to train your magical skills and free the world from the curse that threatens innocent creatures. <br>Meet other apprentices while exploring the academy and uncover its secrets at your own pace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/e4556f0d67f12e14e01268c905ca9434.poster.avif?t=1746037151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/e4556f0d67f12e14e01268c905ca9434.webm?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/e4556f0d67f12e14e01268c905ca9434.mp4?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>TRAIN YOUR MAGICAL SKILLS BY ATTENDING CLASSES:</strong> In the botanic class, attend your garden to grow and harvest fresh vegetables. <br>Catch and collect spell-creatures in the spell class. Learn other skills such as how to brew powerful potions, craft charms and heal creatures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/2f286eda94e3a807faec8117a2ac6fb1.poster.avif?t=1746037151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/2f286eda94e3a807faec8117a2ac6fb1.webm?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/2f286eda94e3a807faec8117a2ac6fb1.mp4?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>BEFRIEND OTHER APPRENTICES:</strong> Meet a cast of unique characters and together explore the academy to uncover all its secrets. Be a part of their stories and form great relationships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.poster.avif?t=1746037151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.webm?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.mp4?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PERSONALISE YOUR CHARACTER AND YOUR CAT:</strong> You can change the appearance of your character and your spirit companion as well!<br>Enjoy chilling with your spirit companion, form a strong bond with them by giving them loving pats, treats and playing games. Your cat will always be there for you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/85eafd2e26ddc3267a0016eca5988542.avif?t=1746037151\" /></div><br><br><strong>OUTSIDE THE ACADEMY:</strong> Explore the surroundings of the academy and discover all its secrets or just relax while practising bug catching, fishing, foraging or cooking.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0b75b1a6da5d3e3f20cd863ac9db031a.avif?t=1746037151\" /></div>",
