n\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.poster.avif?t=1746037151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.webm?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0d040eb5d3705e40f0f0bab142321a76.mp4?t=1746037151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PERSONALISE YOUR CHARACTER AND YOUR CAT:</strong> You can change the appearance of your character and your spirit companion as well!<br>Enjoy chilling with your spirit companion, form a strong bond with them by giving them loving pats, treats and playing games. Your cat will always be there for you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/85eafd2e26ddc3267a0016eca5988542.avif?t=1746037151\" /></div><br><br><strong>OUTSIDE THE ACADEMY:</strong> Explore the surroundings of the academy and discover all its secrets or just relax while practising bug catching, fishing, foraging or cooking.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/0b75b1a6da5d3e3f20cd863ac9db031a.avif?t=1746037151\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Kitori Academy is a life simulator where you live the adventures of a wizard apprentice with your spirit companion. Train your magical skills and learn how to brew potions, grow vegetables and catch spells to challenge the curse that lurks in the world.",
